# Density Compare
# Krypton (Kr) — real density 0.0037 g/cm³. equal masses: Krypton vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Krypton Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 129.2mm color: #5cb8d1 at (-20mm, 64.6mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
